{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f3633b7e-0909-883d-b187-324429c97127",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T11:47:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonella Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:42:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:42:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good morning. Yes, um, I have a question, I wrote it down. One moment please. [pause] I want to put a banner on my shop, for a sale. One week only. How do I get the approval?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:43:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a banner. Is it going on the building, or on a pole, or in the window?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:43:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On the building. On the front, over the door. It is cloth, with the words. Sale, fifty percent. Is this a permit? I do not know if the banner is the same as a sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:43:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. In our office it'd fall under a sign permit, even for a temporary banner. Short-term ones are usually handled a little different from a permanent sign, but you'd still apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:43:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sign permit. Okay. Sorry, I am writing. [pause] Sign. Permit. And the temporary, it is a different paper?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:43:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Might be the same application, with the dates marked. I'd have to pull the form to say for sure. Where's the shop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:44:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two forty-six Kingston Avenue. Two, four, six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:44:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two forty-six Kingston. That's in the Historic Hill area, so I'll note that, because the historic district can add a review step on what goes on a building front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A review? What is the review? Somebody comes to see the banner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:44:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not usually for a banner. They look at the application, the size, the wording, where it's attached. Do you know how big it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:44:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um. [pause] Yes, I have it here. Three feet, by ten feet. Or, ten feet by three. I am sorry, my hands, they are shaking a little. I drank too much coffee this morning. I am very jittery."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:44:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, take your time. Three by ten, got it. And do you own the building, or are you renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. The owner is the landlord, he is the owner of the building. I rent the shop. Must he sign the paper?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:45:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably, yes. Usually we want the property owner's okay on the application if you're a tenant. So get a signature from him or a letter saying it's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:45:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A letter. Okay. Letter from landlord. [pause] And the fee. How much is the fee? I wrote, how much is the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:45:26-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact number in front of me, and it can depend on the size and how long it's up. The fee schedule is posted on the city website, or I can have someone in the office confirm it when you come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:45:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The website, I look. But is it big money? For one week? I think it must be small, for one week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:45:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can't promise it's small or big until you see the schedule. Temporary is generally less than permanent, I can say that much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:46:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay. And how long it takes? The sale is next Saturday, so, a week from now. Is it enough time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:46:10-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's tight, to be honest. If the historic review applies, that could eat some days. I'd get the application in today or tomorrow if you can. Come to the office, bring the size, the wording, and the owner's letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today or tomorrow. Yes. Where is the office? City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:46:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, City Hall, Zoning and Inspections. We're open weekdays during regular business hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:46:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Wait, I am confused one thing. You say the banner is a sign permit, but also the historic, that is another permit? Two permits?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:46:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One application, the sign permit. The historic part is just a review that might come along with it. You don't fill out a whole separate permit unless they tell you to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. One paper, maybe a review. Okay. I think I understand. A little. [pause] Can I give my number, in case you need to call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:47:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four, zero, one. Five, five, five. Zero, one, nine, six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-six. Got it. Antonella, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:47:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Antonella Conti. C, O, N, T, I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Bring the letter and the size, and we'll go from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T11:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
